offline mocks only — no LLM API, no network at runtime
eval: purged OOS mean daily CS RankIC + DSR(N) + shared 10bps+impact costs
cite: RD-Agent(Q) arXiv:2505.15155; Lopez-Lira&Tang arXiv:2304.07619
