=== mock RD-Agent(Q) loop (Research → Development → Co-STEER-style keep/reject) ===
real paper: Research sets goal-aligned prompts/hypotheses; Development implements;
factor–model co-optimization with iterative feedback (NeurIPS 2025 / arXiv:2505.15155).
here: a formula bank stands in for LLM proposals; bandit keeps top by IS IC (danger!).
IS days=400 sealed_OOS days=120 (freeze then open once)

-- Research round 1: mock LLM proposes 3 hypotheses --
  propose mom5         IS_mean_CS_IC=-0.0022 t=-0.20 → reject_weak_IS
  propose noise_A      IS_mean_CS_IC=+0.0149 t=1.79 → keep_IS_ic>0.01
  propose rev5         IS_mean_CS_IC=+0.0022 t=0.20 → reject_weak_IS

-- Research round 2: mock LLM proposes 3 hypotheses --
  propose mom20        IS_mean_CS_IC=+0.0051 t=0.45 → reject_weak_IS
  propose slow_lag1    IS_mean_CS_IC=+0.0320 t=4.20 → keep_IS_ic>0.01
  propose vol20        IS_mean_CS_IC=+0.0049 t=0.42 → reject_weak_IS

-- Research round 3: mock LLM proposes 2 hypotheses --
  propose mom5_x_vol   IS_mean_CS_IC=-0.0009 t=-0.09 → reject_weak_IS
  propose noise_B      IS_mean_CS_IC=+0.0014 t=0.18 → reject_weak_IS

kept factors after agent loop: ['noise_A', 'slow_lag1']
explicit trial count N_TRIALS_AGENT=8 (for DSR)

=== purged / sealed OOS evaluation (same framework as P4/P5) ===
agent_kept       purged_OOF_IC=+0.0299 IS_net_SR=-6.646 DSR(N=8)=0.000 | sealed_OOS_IC=+0.0161 OOS_net_SR=-7.707 OOS_DSR=0.000
honest_slow      purged_OOF_IC=+0.0320 IS_net_SR=-0.991 DSR(N=1)=0.107 | sealed_OOS_IC=+0.0154 OOS_net_SR=-2.171 OOS_DSR=0.067

=== Quant-Arena spirit (arXiv:2610.30113) ===
freeze factor list AFTER IS loop; evaluate sealed hold-out ONCE; no peeking / re-mining.
frozen_kept=['noise_A', 'slow_lag1']
sealed_OOS_IC agent=+0.0161 vs honest=+0.0154

=== mock Lopez-Lira & Tang (2023) headline sentiment (offline) ===
paper: GPT scores on post-knowledge-cutoff headlines predict reactions/drift (arXiv:2304.07619).
here: synthetic 'headlines' → mock_sentiment in [-1,1]; NO ChatGPT call.
mock_sentiment_PIT     post_cutoff mean_CS_IC=+0.0011 t=0.12 net_SR=-12.015 DSR(N=2)=0.000
mock_sentiment_LEAK    post_cutoff mean_CS_IC=+0.6740 t=125.99 net_SR=48.362 DSR(N=2)=1.000
teach: LEAK foil inflates IC (cutoff/memorization analogue); PIT mock is the honest path.

=== Chain-of-Alpha (arXiv:2508.06312) — WITHDRAWN ===
Verified on arXiv: entry exists but admin comment says version removed
(submitter lacked rights to agree to license). DROP detailed dual-chain claims.
Prefer stable cites: RD-Agent(Q), LLM+MCTS (2505.11122), Quant-Arena (2610.30113).

=== limitations / failure modes (must-read) ===
- LLM training cutoff / memorization: scores on pre-cutoff headlines are not forecasts.
- Agent loops multiply trials → DSR needs explicit N; paper metrics ≠ your OOS edge.
- IS keep rules (IC>threshold) overfit; sealed hold-out must stay sealed.
- Formula banks / CoT traces can look interpretable while mining noise.
- Chain-of-Alpha withdrawn: do not rely on unstable PDFs.

